&lt;p&gt;I see that in some fonts sharp angle between paths is padded. What do you call this thing? What&amp;rsquo;s the purpose of this? How large should it be?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for any answer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20140718201047im_/http:/typophile.com/files/Whatsthis_5473.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Looking for this dotted font version</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/103255/</link><pubDate>Thu, 23 May 2013 07:57:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/103255/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I am looking for this cool dotted font:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20131020232339/http:/www.toanvuhuu.com/fileadmin/work/CV_Toan_Vu-Huu_12-03.pdf" title="http://www.toanvuhuu.com/fileadmin/work/CV_Toan_Vu-Huu_12-03.pdf"&gt;http://www.toanvuhuu.com/fileadmin/work/CV_Toan_Vu-Huu_12-03.pdf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
